<title>GREECE: Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices.</p>
<p>					 Nov 13/Nov 12   Nov 13/Dec 31, 95</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.01		10.89</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.03		11.98</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.23		 5.75</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -0.69		-3.04</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.69		36.93</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.74		42.39</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.00	     -23.60</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -0.13		-7.26</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.71		50.44</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.77		57.42</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.22	     -20.62</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -0.81	     -10.98</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31, 1991. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
